ething  about the system if you know that energy  is conserved or mass is conserved  you can dramatically improve the  learning of these systems by enforcing  those constraints enforcing those  symmetries and those conservation laws  directly in the learning procedure so  will show that you get more  interpretable models you can learn with  less data if you bake in what you know  about the physics into this this  dynamical system learning procedure ok  so I'm excited to take you through this  this is an emerging field it's really  there's a tremendous amount of potential  already people have made incredibly  impressive and powerful demonstrations  of how to how to discover dynamical  systems from data people are making  progress on these high-level goals but  this is a rapidly emerging field and so  you know if you get interested in this  you can directly help move this field  forward okay more to come thank you
 

